{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302120","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130212001:1":{"text":"무서워하지 마세요. 잘 길들어진 강철 악어는 온순해서 사람을 공격하지 않으니까요.","source_cn":"不要害怕，被驯养后的钢颚兽非常温驯，不会攻击人类的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x207ACC991A2A3766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130212002:1":{"text":"먹이는 적게, 짐은 많게! 하루에 건초 한 줌이면 충분합니다.","source_cn":"吃的少，驮得多。一把干草就能让它干一天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3445F7D272E8CBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130212003:1":{"text":"사막의 상인들이 카멜로수스를 애용하는 데엔 다 이유가 있는 거 아니겠습니까?","source_cn":"沙漠行商的商队都喜欢用它运货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01C470BB21C339EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血商人伊雷德":{"text":"트라이브 상인 이레이드","source":"蛮血商人伊雷德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}